<p class="muted">
  Drawn from <code>config/context_map.rb</code>. Solid = async events (OHS/PL → ACL/Conformist job), dashed = sync facade call.
  Orange with moving dots = events in transit to the downstream context. Red = delivered in the last few seconds.
  Number = messages delivered across the edge. Turn on slow motion in the side panel to watch it.
</p>
<div data-poll="<%= context_map_live_path %>" data-interval="500">
  <%= render "map" %>
</div>
